{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZWuW5UaQkU1793104708.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國地震局公布，上周四西藏巴青縣的7級地震最高烈度達9度，造成長約20公里的地表破裂帶。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE.FOLO-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026tFSytKGkyb1793106845.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這次地震震央巴青縣瑪如鄉以及青海雜多縣查旦鄉等地，約有450平方公里的區域，在分成12度的地震烈度中，達到9度，即代表地震震度令大多數房屋被破壞、少數倒塌，鐵軌彎曲等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE.FOLO 1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FFMIDDaFLi1793106878.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>地震局在瑪如鄉約20公里處，發現長約20公里的地表破裂帶，最深約3.5米，寬約8至30米，南北兩側延伸到雪山上。</p><p></p><p>今次地震已造成16人死亡、76人受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:58.061366+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13.909309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:34.445297+00:00","content_hash":"d4074b8a666f2991795d680b47d103969a8c1f9bde80dc323b9c6cfe5fed370a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:58.061366+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}